    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A big dream born in a small garage... Are you ready to build your own E-Commerce network from scratch?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a humble beginning, you\u2019ll craft your unique business model and step into the competitive world of modern E-Commerce. All you have is a limited budget \u2014 and an unshakable determination. The road ahead won\u2019t be easy. Even gaining support from those closest to you will require proving your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision, every investment, and every opportunity will shape your future. From organizing products and fulfilling orders, to packaging and ensuring customer satisfaction \u2014 every detail is in your hands. Take risks, grow, explore\u2026 and rise to become one of the strongest players in the digital marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're ready\u2026 it's time to write your own E-Commerce story.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A big dream born in a small garage... Are you ready to build your own E-Commerce network from scratch?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a humble beginning, you\u2019ll craft your unique business model and step into the competitive world of modern E-Commerce. All you have is a limited budget \u2014 and an unshakable determination. The road ahead won\u2019t be easy. Even gaining support from those closest to you will require proving your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision, every investment, and every opportunity will shape your future. From organizing products and fulfilling orders, to packaging and ensuring customer satisfaction \u2014 every detail is in your hands. Take risks, grow, explore\u2026 and rise to become one of the strongest players in the digital marketplace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>If you're ready\u2026 it's time to write your own E-Commerce story.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "A journey that begins in a small garage could lead you to a massive E-Commerce empire. Every decision will shape your future. From placing products and preparing orders to packaging and customer satisfaction \u2014 every detail is in your hands. If you're ready, it's time to write your own story!",
